--CONTEXT API IN REACT---

The React Context API is a built-in feature that allows you to share data 
globally across your component tree without passing props manually down through
 every level, a problem known as prop drilling. It is ideal for passing down 
 data that many components need, such as UI themes, authenticated user data, 
 or language settings.

